lgian had there in 1976). The car spun several times and then hit the barrier, knocking off a rear wheel.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":19},{"lap":1,"text":"Rebaque's race was over, but Fittipaldi managed to get his car in gear, nursed it around for a lap while it cooled off, and then drove through the field to finish fifth.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":4},{"lap":3,"text":"Immediately, his lead began to disintegrate. On lap three, Reutemann went by, and on lap four, Villeneuve.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":23,"text":"Then, on lap 23, Villeneuve's engine blew a piston, and Jones, who had overtaken Andretti two laps earlier, inherited second, 35 seconds behind Reutemann.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":22},{"lap":56,"text":"Jarier's race ended with three and a half laps to go when he ran out of fuel, giving Scheckter the final podium position.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":14},{"lap":59,"text":"On lap 25, Lauda passed Andretti for third, and three laps later, Andretti's engine blew.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":18},{"lap":59,"text":"Reutemann came home almost twenty seconds ahead of Jones to take the eighth Grand Prix win of his career, the third in the US.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}]}